SUMMARY:The Boston Symphony Orchestra and ICA/Boston present Sudan Archives
 : Any Shape I Want
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:Sudan Archives brings a new performance to the Institute of Con
 temporary Art/Boston in a co-production with the Boston Symphony Orchestra
  as part of the BSO’s Creation Festival. The New York Times has called h
 er “an artist in a league of her own\,” and Pitchfork praised her “t
 hrillingly original” fusion of sound and storytelling.\nhttps://www.icab
 oston.org/events/boston-symphony-orchestra-ica-boston-sudan-archives-any-s
 hape-i-want/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.icaboston.org/events/boston-symphony-orchestra-ica-boston-s
 udan-archives-any-shape-i-want/
